<section class="ast-diagram">
    <h2>How does microfluidics-based AST work?</h2>
    <p class="diagram-caption">Patient sample and antibiotic are loaded into chamber A</p>

    <div class="diagram-body">
        <div class="diagram-col diagram-col--left">
            <h3>Hydrogel channel</h3>
            <p>Allows antibiotics to diffuse slowly in 2 - 3 hours, while preventing cells from passing through</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Placeholder for a future 3D model of the chip. -->
        <div class="model-placeholder">3D img placeholder</div>

        <div class="diagram-col diagram-col--right">
            <div class="chamber">
                <h3>Chamber A</h3>
                <p>Where patient sample and antibiotic interacts, and antibiotic degradation occurs within 1-4 hours</p>
            </div>
            <div class="chamber">
                <h3>Chamber B</h3>
                <p>Biosensor E. coli interacts with intact/degraded antibiotic</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="legend">
        <p><mark class="legend-susceptible">Fluorescent output</mark> = sample is susceptible</p>
        <p>No fluorescence = sample is <mark class="legend-resistant">resistant</mark></p>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .ast-diagram {
        margin: 0 auto;
        max-width: 70rem;
        padding: 4rem 2rem;
    }

    .ast-diagram h2 {
        color: var(--color-periwinkle);
        font-family: var(--font-geist);
        font-size: 36px;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1.2;
        margin: 0 0 2rem;
    }

    /* Extra .ast-diagram qualifier needed to out-specificity MainLayout's
       global ".page-content :global(p)" rule, which otherwise overrides
       this margin (and would un-center it). */
    .ast-diagram .diagram-caption {
        color: var(--color-periwinkle);
        font-family: var(--font-geist);
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1.4;
        margin: 0 auto 3rem;
        max-width: 28rem;
        text-align: center;
        width: fit-content;
    }

    .diagram-body {
        align-items: stretch;
        display: grid;
        gap: 2rem;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    }

    .diagram-col {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0rem;
        margin-left: 4rem;
        margin-right: 4rem;
    }

    .diagram-col--left {
        justify-content: center;
        text-align: right;
    }

    .diagram-col--right {
        justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .diagram-col h3,
    .chamber h3 {
        color: var(--color-periwinkle);
        font-family: var(--font-geist);
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    }

    .diagram-col p,
    .chamber p {
        color: var(--color-periwinkle);
        font-family: var(--font-source-serif-4);
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.5;
        margin: 0;
    }

    .model-placeholder {
        align-items: center;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        color: var(--color-ebony-clay);
        display: flex;
        font-family: var(--font-geist);
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 700;
        justify-content: center;
        min-height: 24rem;
        padding: 1rem;
        text-align: center;
        width: min(20rem, 40vw);
    }

    .legend {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        margin-top: 3rem;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .legend p {
        color: var(--color-periwinkle);
        font-family: var(--font-geist);
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin: 0;
    }

    .legend mark {
        background-color: var(--color-fluorescence);
        color: var(--color-ebony-clay);
        padding: 0 0.3rem;
    }

    .legend mark.legend-resistant {
        background-color: var(--color-orchid);
    }

    @media (max-width: 750px) {
        .diagram-body {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .diagram-col--left,
        .diagram-col--right {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .model-placeholder {
            margin: 0 auto;
            width: 100%;
        }
    }
</style>
